#X msg 260 4098 trg \$1;
#X text 82 4128 egi (0): EG INT 0-15 \, DEG3 moves the cutoff up to 7.9 octaves. \; pol (2): 2 up \, 1 down. \; trg (2): 2 multi: every key restarts DEG3 \, 1 single: only the first key of a phrase., f 64;
