#X text 82 4542 drv (0): overdrive (not on the Poly-800) \, soft clipping \, 0-127 = 0-48 dB more gain with level makeup. \; drvp (0): 0 post: after the VCF \, denser with res and chords \, 1 pre: into the VCF \, which rounds the distortion off (warmer)., f 64;
#X obj 460 4634 s \$0-pdoly8;
#X floatatom 60 4610 6 0 127 0 - - -;
