#X msg 160 8044 r1 \$1;
#X text 82 8074 a1 d1 bp1 sl1 su1 r1: attack \, decay \, break point \, slope \, sustain \, release of DEG1 (DCO1) \, 0-31. Setting one makes env1 -1., f 64;
